WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:04.200
♪♪

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.634
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:07.667
Former President Trump
over the weekend

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:11.634
kicked off his 2024 campaign,
Merrick.

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:13.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:16.701
Former President Trump kicked
off his 2024 campaign

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:19.534
on Saturday at the New Hampshire
Republican Party's

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:23.133
annual meeting
and said, "I'm more angry now,

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:25.334
and I'm more committed now than
I ever was."

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:28.767
Though it's never a good sign
when your opening pitch is,

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:30.901
I'm blind with rage.

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:33.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.234
While speaking on Saturday
in New Hampshire,

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:38.701
former President Trump said the
Taliban were incapable

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:41.968
of fighting at night because
they don't have binoculars.

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:43.434
I'm --

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:45.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.267
I'm sorry.
Do you think binoculars

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.701
help you see at night?

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:50.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:52.367
"Officer, I know you
pulled me over for not

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:53.601
having my headlights on.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:56.801
But don't worry,
I got my binoculars."

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:58.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.667 --> 00:00:59.801
"Now I know what
you're thinking.

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:01.100
I can't hold the steering wheel

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.267
when I'm holding my binoculars."

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:06.434
"For that, you can write me
a ticket."

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:07.868
President Biden,
and Vice President

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.400
Kamala Harris are set to travel
to Philadelphia on

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.133
Friday for the DNC's
winter convention.

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:15.334
For those who don't know
what that is,

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:18.767
winter used to be a season where
it was really cold outside.

00:01:18.767 --> 00:01:20.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:23.634
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz
discussed his role

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:26.634
in the contentious speakership
election in a new interview

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:30.367
and said he's "not some
'Lord of the Flies' nihilist."

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.868
"We're reading that in class,"
said his girlfriend.

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:35.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.000
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.033
It's a good book.

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:46.501
New York Mayor -- New York Mayor
Eric Adams told reporters

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:48.601
last week that he thinks
Republican Congressman

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:50.300
George Santos should resign.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:53.367
While Santos disagreed and said
he's actually

00:01:53.367 --> 00:01:54.467
the Mayor of New York City.

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:57.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.801
A 29-year-old recently
attempted to enroll

00:01:59.801 --> 00:02:01.534
at a high school in New Jersey,

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:04.000
which I think was the plot
of "Grease?"

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:11.400
That's right, a 29-year-old
woman was charged last week

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.968
with providing a false
government document

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:15.300
after she allegedly provided
a fake birth certificate

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.267
and tried to enroll
at a New Jersey high school.

00:02:17.267 --> 00:02:19.567
Teachers knew something was off
after it seemed like

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:21.000
she wanted to be there.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:28.801
The San Antonio Zoo is offering
a Valentine's Day promotion

00:02:28.801 --> 00:02:32.234
to name a cockroach after
customers' exes for $10.

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:33.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:36.834
Meanwhile, they'll do it
for 5 bucks at Arby's.

00:02:36.834 --> 00:02:39.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:42.400
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.901
"Yeah, just take your pick."

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:46.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.868 --> 00:02:49.434
And finally, authorities in
Australia have recently begun

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:52.400
searching for a missing
radioactive capsule.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.567
And they think
they just found it.

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:57.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.033 --> 00:02:58.300
[ Laughs ]

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.100
President Biden
informed Congress yesterday

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.501
that he will officially end

00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:07.901
the coronavirus pandemic
emergency declaration in May,

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:09.968
which means that everyone
can finally

00:03:09.968 --> 00:03:12.300
stop wearing their mask
a year ago.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.267 --> 00:03:16.400
President Biden visited
New York City today

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.100
and spoke about how the
bipartisan infrastructure law

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.267
will improve
the Hudson River Tunnel

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:23.000
that connects
New York and New Jersey.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.200
The biggest improvement --

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.868
it will no longer connect
to New Jersey.

00:03:26.868 --> 00:03:28.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:30.434
[ Applause ]

00:03:30.434 --> 00:03:33.000
The Biden administration
unveiled a proposal yesterday

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.767
that would make birth control
more easily accessible.

00:03:35.767 --> 00:03:38.767
That's great.
Now can you do razors?

00:03:38.767 --> 00:03:41.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:43.000
President Biden
confirmed last week

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.267
that White House chief of staff
Ron Klain

00:03:45.267 --> 00:03:47.667
will step down in
the coming weeks and said,

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:49.467
"The real mark of Ron's success

00:03:49.467 --> 00:03:52.033
is that he's beloved
by the team he leads."

00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:54.667
Though I'd say
the real mark of Ron's success

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.901
is that this is the first
we're all hearing of him.

00:03:57.901 --> 00:04:00.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.968
President Biden is set to travel
to Philadelphia this week

00:04:02.968 --> 00:04:04.868
to discuss
an infrastructure project

00:04:04.868 --> 00:04:07.133
that will replace lead pipes.

00:04:07.133 --> 00:04:10.801
But then how are Philadelphians
supposed to collect their debts?

00:04:10.801 --> 00:04:12.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.934 --> 00:04:19.467
According to a new survey,
people don't want their partners

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:22.601
to earn
less than $30,000 a year.

00:04:22.601 --> 00:04:24.267
This news first reported

00:04:24.267 --> 00:04:27.000
by a guidance counselor
to a philosophy major.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:33.434
"But, like, can you even
name one who's working today?"

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:36.200
After vacationing
for the last month in Orlando,

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.601
former Brazilian president
Jair Bolsonaro

00:04:38.601 --> 00:04:41.467
has reportedly applied
for a six-month visitor visa.

00:04:41.467 --> 00:04:43.067
I'm sorry.

00:04:43.067 --> 00:04:47.133
You saw Orlando
and wanted to stay longer?

00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:48.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.434 --> 00:04:51.801
"An IHOP and an Applebee's!

00:04:51.801 --> 00:04:54.834
Call the consulate
and tell them I'm not leaving!"

00:04:54.834 --> 00:04:56.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.267 --> 00:04:59.100
The U.K. announced plans today
to improve its environment

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.300
and hopes to restore
at least 1.2 million acres

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:05.167
of wildlife habitat
to protect rare species

00:05:05.167 --> 00:05:08.033
like hedgehogs
and red squirrels.

00:05:08.033 --> 00:05:09.601
Because if those die out,

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:12.501
it could mean the end of the
traditional English breakfast.

00:05:12.501 --> 00:05:13.934
[ Audience groans ]

00:05:13.934 --> 00:05:16.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.667 --> 00:05:19.567
[British accent] "The best we
can do is Impossible hedgehog."

00:05:19.567 --> 00:05:24.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.467
Florida law-- [ Laughs ]

00:05:26.467 --> 00:05:29.634
Florida lawmakers
proposed legislation yesterday

00:05:29.634 --> 00:05:32.567
that would allow residents to
carry firearms without a permit.

00:05:32.567 --> 00:05:33.934
I don't know.
I guess they figure

00:05:33.934 --> 00:05:35.667
it can't be any more dangerous

00:05:35.667 --> 00:05:37.868
than letting
100-year-olds drive.

00:05:37.868 --> 00:05:39.868
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.868 --> 00:05:41.534
And, finally,
according to a new study,

00:05:41.534 --> 00:05:44.334
kids missed about 35%
of a normal year's worth

00:05:44.334 --> 00:05:46.334
of learning during
the coronavirus pandemic.

00:05:46.334 --> 00:05:50.434
Said kids, "Oh, my God!
That's more than half a year!"

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:54.701
President Biden is said to have
his annual physical

00:05:54.701 --> 00:05:56.000
later this month.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.834
Well, at least that's one probe
that won't turn up

00:05:58.834 --> 00:05:59.968
any documents.

00:05:59.968 --> 00:06:02.534
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.534 --> 00:06:05.701
God willing.

00:06:05.701 --> 00:06:07.801
The FBI reportedly searched
President Biden's

00:06:07.801 --> 00:06:09.133
Delaware beach house today

00:06:09.133 --> 00:06:10.868
as part of the ongoing
investigation

00:06:10.868 --> 00:06:12.834
into his handling
of classified documents.

00:06:12.834 --> 00:06:14.901
And I think he might
be getting nervous,

00:06:14.901 --> 00:06:17.467
because he said, "You know what
you should be searching?

00:06:17.467 --> 00:06:20.901
Hunter's laptop.

00:06:20.901 --> 00:06:22.234
Crazy stuff in there."

00:06:22.234 --> 00:06:24.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.334 --> 00:06:26.467
Democratic Congressman
Jamie Raskin asked

00:06:26.467 --> 00:06:29.400
the Secret Service yesterday
to turn over visitor logs

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.400
to Mar-a-Lago and former
Vice President Mike Pence's

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:33.400
Indiana home.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:34.501
Let me save you the time --

00:06:34.501 --> 00:06:36.868
Domino's guy and no one.

00:06:36.868 --> 00:06:39.767
[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.767 --> 00:06:42.601
The Biden administration
proposed new rules today

00:06:42.601 --> 00:06:44.601
that would limit
credit card company fees

00:06:44.601 --> 00:06:45.934
for missed payments.

00:06:45.934 --> 00:06:48.901
"Oh, I never charge anything,"
said Merrick Garland.

00:06:48.901 --> 00:06:51.767
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.767 --> 00:06:53.334
[ Audience murmurs ]

00:06:53.334 --> 00:06:55.100
[ Groans ]

00:06:55.901 --> 00:06:58.501
According to a new poll,
15% of voters said

00:06:58.501 --> 00:06:59.567
that the most important problem

00:06:59.567 --> 00:07:01.334
facing the county's inflation --

00:07:01.334 --> 00:07:03.000
oh, wait, now it's 20%?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.167
Oh, God, now it's 25-- 30%?

00:07:05.167 --> 00:07:06.868
Oh, my God, you know what?
I'm gonna stop looking.

00:07:06.868 --> 00:07:08.501
I'm gonna just stop looking.

00:07:09.667 --> 00:07:11.634
Authorities in Texas
yesterday located

00:07:11.634 --> 00:07:15.601
the two emperor tamarin monkeys
that went from the Dallas Zoo

00:07:15.601 --> 00:07:18.133
inside the closet
of an abandoned home.

00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:20.467
And they left them there because
at this point,

00:07:20.467 --> 00:07:23.100
that's a more secure location
than the Dallas Zoo.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:25.434
[ Laughter ]

00:07:25.434 --> 00:07:27.667
Tomorrow is groundhog day,
which is weird,

00:07:27.667 --> 00:07:30.667
'cause we still haven't had
the first six weeks of winter.

00:07:30.667 --> 00:07:32.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:32.968 --> 00:07:35.901
According to new analysis,
the price of beef is expected

00:07:35.901 --> 00:07:39.400
to increase this year by 15%,
so it's gonna be weird

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.067
when the price
of a Quarter Pounder doesn't.

00:07:42.067 --> 00:07:46.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:46.234 --> 00:07:48.400
Then what is it?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.701
[ Laughter ]

00:07:50.701 --> 00:07:53.367
And finally, the candy executive
who's credited

00:07:53.367 --> 00:07:56.200
as the father of Peeps, for
creating the marshmallow treat,

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.467
died recently at the age of 98.

00:07:58.467 --> 00:08:01.667
And his last words were, "Please
don't let them call me

00:08:01.667 --> 00:08:03.000
the father of Peeps."

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.400
[ Laughter ]

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.734
According to a new poll,
President Biden's

00:08:07.734 --> 00:08:11.100
approval rating has risen
1 point over the last month.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.067
So now he's going to keep
discovering more and more

00:08:14.067 --> 00:08:18.501
classified documents
until he clinches re-election.

00:08:18.501 --> 00:08:20.701
The FBI searched
President Biden's Delaware

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:22.167
beach house yesterday
and reported

00:08:22.167 --> 00:08:24.601
that they did not
find any classified documents.

00:08:24.601 --> 00:08:25.934
Of course not.

00:08:25.934 --> 00:08:28.534
You think that's what Joe Biden
reads at the beach?

00:08:28.534 --> 00:08:32.801
It's Tom Clancy
or nothing down there.

00:08:32.801 --> 00:08:36.434
After facing criticism from
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis,

00:08:36.434 --> 00:08:39.467
the College Board yesterday
released a revised framework

00:08:39.467 --> 00:08:42.701
for its new A.P.
African-American Studies course,

00:08:42.701 --> 00:08:44.400
which no longer
features sections on

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:48.400
reparations, prison abolition,
and black queer studies.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.968
Instead, students will just
watch "Friends."

00:08:56.067 --> 00:08:57.934
At a House Judiciary Committee
meeting yesterday,

00:08:57.934 --> 00:08:59.601
Florida Congressman
Matt Gaetz proposed

00:08:59.601 --> 00:09:01.834
that every meeting begin with
the pledge of allegiance,

00:09:01.834 --> 00:09:05.300
just like they do
at his girlfriend's school.

00:09:09.234 --> 00:09:12.133
The New York groundhog
Staten Island Chuck

00:09:12.133 --> 00:09:13.801
did not see his shadow today.

00:09:13.801 --> 00:09:17.367
Said residents,
"Yeah, you didn't see nothin'."

00:09:22.767 --> 00:09:24.901
During this year's annual
Groundhog Day celebration,

00:09:24.901 --> 00:09:27.634
Punxsutawney Phil predicted
another six weeks of winter.

00:09:27.634 --> 00:09:30.901
Okay, but did he
see his shadow or a calendar?

00:09:30.901 --> 00:09:34.467
Of course winter's not over.
It's February 2nd.

00:09:34.467 --> 00:09:35.501
There's still football.

00:09:35.501 --> 00:09:37.734
Can we at least move
the stupid ritual

00:09:37.734 --> 00:09:42.133
to mid-March,
where there's a little mystery?

00:09:42.133 --> 00:09:44.601
The Federal Reserve raised
interest rates yesterday

00:09:44.601 --> 00:09:46.300
by a quarter point,
which is going to make it

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:50.667
even harder to get approved
for a loan to buy eggs.

00:09:53.167 --> 00:09:55.300
The fast-food chain Subway
has announced

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.801
that it will begin slicing meat
in-store in front of customers.

00:09:58.801 --> 00:10:01.667
And it can't be a good sign
when your customers' reaction

00:10:01.667 --> 00:10:04.734
to your sandwiches is,
"Prove it."

00:10:08.634 --> 00:10:10.334
"I'll wait."

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:15.334
Amid reports that the retailer
will file for bankruptcy,

00:10:15.334 --> 00:10:16.901
Bed Bath &amp; Beyond
announced yesterday

00:10:16.901 --> 00:10:19.601
it will close 87 stores
across the country.

00:10:19.601 --> 00:10:22.434
But, remember,
every time God closes a door,

00:10:22.434 --> 00:10:25.334
he opens a Spirit Halloween.

00:10:27.734 --> 00:10:29.968
And, finally,
a 6-year-old in Michigan

00:10:29.968 --> 00:10:32.767
recently ordered
about $1,000 worth of food

00:10:32.767 --> 00:10:35.601
on a delivery app while
playing with his father's phone.

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:39.434
Even more impressive,
his wife bought that story.

00:10:41.868 --> 00:10:45.667
"I mean, I feel like I should
eat it since it's here."

00:10:45.667 --> 00:10:47.634
That was the monologue,
everybody!

